Clerks are reminded of the \
procedure for foreign leaves \
found in the bound registers. \
#v(-0.25em) \
Leaves have been found sewn into \
finished registers with waxed \
yellow thread. The paper of the \
leaves is older than the paper \
of the register into which they \
are sewn. The hand is not the \
hand of any clerk in this \
office. \
#v(-0.25em) \
